        },
        "committer": {
          "name": "Keguang Xu",
          "email": "kxu@ddn.com",
          "date": "2026-11-09 04:26:00.000000000",
          "tz": 480
        },
        "subject": "LU-19823 lod: count unique OSTs for multi-set parity",
        "message": "LU-19823 lod: count unique OSTs for multi-set parity\n\nMulti-raidset parity reused data OSTs from other sets, so\nlod_stripe_count_min() returned 0 unique OSTs.  Each set can\nreuse at most (c - k) such OSTs; when p is larger, the rest\nmust be unique.  With sibling -c mirrors filling the pool at\nspeed 0, resync then hit ENOSPC before raising speed.\n\nRequire sum max(0, p - (c - k)) unique OSTs before reuse, and\ncover it with sanity-ec 8q.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity-ec ostcount=8\nFixes: c53abca9f9ee (\"LU-19852 lod: raidset aware stripe allocator\")\nSigned-off-by: Keguang Xu <kxu@ddn.com>\nAssisted-by: Cursor:Composer\nChange-Id: Ifca03e16c692665e618722825b0f9926febb39f9\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
